    "summaryAr": "Are you prepared to fuel the growth of an exciting scale-up that's transforming the logistics industry? Do you thrive on building strategic relationships and close deals? If so, we might have the perfect opportunity for you! Logistics? Maybe not what you dreamed of as a kid. But building a fast-growing international SaaS scale-up that’s transforming how some of the world’s largest industrial companies operate? That’s",
    "descriptionAr": "Are you prepared to fuel the growth of an exciting scale-up that's transforming the logistics industry? Do you thrive on building strategic relationships and close deals? If so, we might have the perfect opportunity for you! Logistics? Maybe not what you dreamed of as a kid. But building a fast-growing international SaaS scale-up that’s transforming how some of the world’s largest industrial companies operate? That’s a different story. Peripass is a tech company at heart. We build software that digitises and automates complex logistics environments for companies like Bridgestone, Alpro and Arcelor Mittal. These companies have hundreds of trucks (un)loading every month, and our SaaS platform helps them orchestrate that whole process. Peripass is a high-impact SaaS platform used in international enterprise environments. Want to be part of this adventure ? As an Account Executive France within the Sales Team, you will have a front-row seat to the growth of an international SaaS scale-up and play a key role in expanding our presence in the French market. Own the full sales cycle: You will be responsible for selling our SaaS solution and independently managing qualified sales opportunities from initial engagement through signed contract. This includes identifying and qualifying prospects, conducting discovery conversations, developing business cases, managing stakeholders, negotiating and closing deals. Build our presence in France: Identify target accounts and create new business opportunities through strategic outbound prospecting and personalised outreach across relevant industries. Work closely with our BDR team to open conversations with new prospects and build awareness of Peripass in the French market. Pipeline momentum and sales velocity: Proactively collaborate with internal stakeholders and customer champions to maintain momentum, reduce sales cycles, and improve win rates. This involves consistent follow-ups, addressing blockers, and aligning on goals. Existing customer growth: Identify opportunities for cross-selling and selling to additional sites within existing customer accounts, in close collaboration with Customer Success and other relevant teams. Deal negotiation and closing: Take commercial leadership in deal negotiation and closure, ensuring alignment with the prospect's needs while achieving company revenue and margin goals. This includes handling objections and finalising contracts. Travel across France: the role involves travelling approximately two to three days per week within France to meet prospects and customers. Work from our new French office : We are soon opening a new office in Paris. Visit our Ghent HQ approximately every six weeks to connect with your colleagues. To get you fully acquainted with your colleagues, you'll also get an in-depth onboarding at our HQ during your first two weeks. You will report directly to our GTM Lead, who is looking forward to coaching you extensively as you build the French market and grow your career at Peripass. What we offer: Front-row seat to scale-up growth: Be part of the next growth phase of Peripass in the French and have a direct impact on building our market presence. Opportunity in a growing market: Be part of a fast-scaling SaaS company revolutionising yard management in logistics, with the opportunity to make an impact in France. Uncapped earning potentia l: A competitive salary with a commission plan that truly rewards success. The more you close, the more you earn. Ownership and freedom: Take charge of your pipeline and strategy. We trust you to drive results, with the flexibility to work how and where you perform best. Backed by a strong team: From BDR and marketing to pre-sales and Customer Success, you'll have a strong team behind you, helping you create, close and grow opportunities. A role with real impact: Help shape our French sales approach, market strategy and way of working as the team and market continue to grow. Awesome office in the heart of Peripass with a dedicated team, combined with travel to clients and the option to work from home. What you’ll bring: At least five years of work experience , including two years of relevant experience owning a full sales cycle. Experience working in a high-growth environment, preferably in SaaS or a similar context. Experience managing complex decision-making units and closing deals of a comparable size. Hunter mindset: You are not afraid of outbound sales or creating opportunities from scratch. Working in a scale-up means that you are willing to hunt, generate leads and actively open doors with new prospects. Of course, you will be supported by our BDR team, but mindset is key! Strong stakeholder management skills for complex decision-making units and sales processes in international corporate environments. Excellent communication and negotiation skills. Excellent written and spoken French and English . Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow",
