    "summaryAr": "Replit is the agentic software creation platform that enables anyone to build applications using natural language. With millions of users worldwide, Replit is democratizing software development by removing traditional barriers to application creation. Responsibilities Drive end-to-end analysis of product data, market research, and competitor analysis to help drive understanding of key business lines and future compan",
    "descriptionAr": "Replit is the agentic software creation platform that enables anyone to build applications using natural language. With millions of users worldwide, Replit is democratizing software development by removing traditional barriers to application creation. Responsibilities Drive end-to-end analysis of product data, market research, and competitor analysis to help drive understanding of key business lines and future company planning. Work cross-functionally with senior leadership and product teams to identify, assess, and execute key opportunities. Scope and execute zero-to-one projects to determine long-term value for the company. Support new go-to-market initiatives, including product launches and influencer campaigns. Manage vendor relationships by combining strategic analysis, execution, and operational rigor to help scale business. Manage and monitor vendor contracts, including both initial procurement and the renewal process. Requirements: Bachelor’s degree, or foreign degree equivalent, in Finance, Business Administration, or a related field. Four (4) years of experience in job offered, Associate Analyst, Associate Consultant, or in a related occupation. Must be authorized to work in the United States. Sponsorship and/or relocation are not available for this position. Academic training or work experience must include: Large-scale data analysis using SQL on Google Cloud BigQuery. Data mining using Braintrust. Building dashboards and data analysis using Hex with Python. Advanced Microsoft Excel analytics including pivot table, XLOOKUP, and data modeling. Regression Modeling. AI usage analytics and business outcome modeling using Python and SQL. This is a full-time role that can be held from our Foster City, CA office. The role has an in-office requirement of Monday, Wednesday, and Friday. Applicants should email resume/cover letter to resumes@replit.com. Must reference REQ #R458 when applying. Full-Time Employee Benefits Include: 💰 Competitive Salary & Equity 💹 401(k) Program with a 4% match ( US Only ) ⚕️ Health, Dental, Vision and Life Insurance 🩼 Short Term and Long Term Disability 🚼 Paid Parental, Medical, Caregiver Leave 🏝 Flexible Time Off (FTO) + Holidays 🚗 Commuter Benefits ( In-Office & US Only ) 📱 Monthly Wellness Stipend 🧑‍💻 Autonomous Work Environment 🖥 In Office Set-Up Reimbursement ( In-Office Only ) 🚀 Quarterly Team Gatherings ☕ In Office Amenities ( In-Office Only ) Want to learn more about what we are up to? Self-driving Company Replit Agent at Scale AI Adoption Build Open-Source Apps Interviewing + Culture at Replit Operating Principles Reasons not to work at Replit To achieve our mission of making programming more accessible around the world, we need our team to be representative of the world. We welcome your unique perspective and experiences in shaping this product. We encourage people from all kinds of backgrounds to apply, including and especially candidates from underrepresented and non-traditional backgrounds.",
