    "languages": [],
    "summaryAr": "Replit is the agentic software creation platform that enables anyone to build applications using natural language. With millions of users worldwide, Replit is democratizing software development by removing traditional barriers to application creation. Enterprise Marketing is responsible for driving B2B pipeline and revenue at Replit. The team partners closely with Sales, RevOps, Product Marketing, and Growth to engag",
    "descriptionAr": "Replit is the agentic software creation platform that enables anyone to build applications using natural language. With millions of users worldwide, Replit is democratizing software development by removing traditional barriers to application creation. Enterprise Marketing is responsible for driving B2B pipeline and revenue at Replit. The team partners closely with Sales, RevOps, Product Marketing, and Growth to engage enterprise buyers and turn demand into qualified opportunities. With millions of individual users already in the product, Replit has a unique opportunity to connect product-led adoption with enterprise growth. About the Role We’re seeking a strategic, execution-oriented Senior Manager, Demand Generation to lead integrated campaigns that accelerate enterprise pipeline and revenue growth at Replit. You’ll own the strategy, execution, and optimization of full-funnel programs that win new customers and expand adoption within existing accounts. Reporting to the Director / Sr. Director of Demand and Digital, you’ll partner with Product Marketing to translate Replit’s AI capabilities, positioning, and customer use cases into compelling campaigns for technical and business audiences. You’ll build account-based programs, launch targeted campaigns, and work closely with Sales to turn engagement into qualified opportunities. You’ll bring deep channel expertise and partner with channel owners to optimize spend, improve conversion, and allocate budget toward programs that deliver the strongest pipeline and revenue impact. This is a hands-on role that combines strategic planning with detailed execution. What You’ll Do Own campaign strategy and pipeline results. Build and execute enterprise demand generation programs with clear audiences, offers, pipeline goals, and measures of success. Build enterprise campaign playbooks. Create repeatable programs across account-based marketing, webinars, content syndication, email nurture, and integrated field marketing. Develop account-based programs. Partner with Sales to select high-value accounts, identify buying groups, and coordinate multi-touch campaigns with relevant sales outreach. Own land-and-expand campaigns. Develop and execute integrated programs across new customer acquisition and account expansion. Partner with Sales to prioritize target accounts and buying groups, tailor campaigns to customer use cases, and generate qualified pipeline for new business, upsell, and cross-sell opportunities. Shape campaign messaging and creative. Collaborate with Product Marketing, Content, and Design to develop compelling assets and offers across the buyer journey, from awareness through opportunity progression. Test and improve performance. Experiment with audiences, messaging, creative formats, calls to action, and landing pages to improve conversion and pipeline quality. Partner with the paid media optimization team to apply findings across campaigns. Connect product-led growth with enterprise sales. Identify expansion signals within Replit’s individual user base and build programs that nurture high-potential users and accounts toward enterprise adoption. Strengthen lead management and sales handoff. Work with Sales, SDRs, and RevOps on targeting, lead scoring, qualification, routing, and follow-up. Partner with Product and Analytics on product-qualified lead signals. Measure and communicate business impact. Track campaign contribution, funnel conversion, and program efficiency. Bring clear insights and recommendations to business reviews, including where to scale, adjust, or stop investment. Deliver high-quality execution. Manage campaign calendars, budgets, and cross-functional dependencies. Coordinate internal teams and external partners to launch programs on time and turn successful experiments into repeatable playbooks. What You’ll Bring A strong desire to learn and apply AI tools to scale campaign execution, automate repetitive work, and improve marketing performance. 10+ years of demand generation experience, including 5+ years in B2B SaaS focused on enterprise customers. A proven track record of building and scaling demand generation programs with measurable pipeline contribution and ROI. Expertise with account-based marketing, including account selection, multi-channel campaigns, engagement measurement, and creative development. Experience developing lead scoring, qualification, and funnel optimization approaches in partnership with Sales and RevOps. Strong analytical skills and a disciplined approach to experimentation—connecting data across sources, interpreting results, and translating findings into action. The ability to provide clear campaign briefs and creative direction while partnering effectively with Content, Product Marketing, and Design. Strong cross-functional communication and project management skills, with the ability to move from strategy to hands-on execution. Must have a strong desire to learn and apply AI tools to scale campaign execution, automate repetitive work, and improve marketing performance. This is a full-time role that can be held from our Foster City, CA office. The role has an in-office requirement of Monday, Wednesday, and Friday. Full-Time Employee Benefits Include: 💰 Competitive Salary & Equity 💹 401(k) Program with a 4% match ( US Only ) ⚕️ Health, Dental, Vision and Life Insurance 🩼 Short Term and Long Term Disability 🚼 Paid Parental, Medical, Caregiver Leave 🏝 Flexible Time Off (FTO) + Holidays 🚗 Commuter Benefits ( In-Office & US Only ) 📱 Monthly Wellness Stipend 🧑‍💻 Autonomous Work Environment 🖥 In Office Set-Up Reimbursement ( In-Office Only ) 🚀 Quarterly Team Gatherings ☕ In Office Amenities ( In-Office Only ) Want to learn more about what we are up to? Self-driving Company Replit Agent at Scale AI Adoption Build Open-Source Apps Interviewing + Culture at Replit Operating Principles Reasons not to work at Replit To achieve our mission of making programming more accessible around the world,",
