    "summaryAr": "About the Team Customer Education helps enterprises develop the capabilities their workforce needs to use AI effectively, build and deploy AI solutions, and get more value from OpenAI’s products. About the Role We’re looking for a Customer Education Adoption Lead to own the adoption and growth strategy for OpenAI’s education programs across enterprise audiences. You will build campaigns, develop distribution channels",
    "descriptionAr": "About the Team Customer Education helps enterprises develop the capabilities their workforce needs to use AI effectively, build and deploy AI solutions, and get more value from OpenAI’s products. About the Role We’re looking for a Customer Education Adoption Lead to own the adoption and growth strategy for OpenAI’s education programs across enterprise audiences. You will build campaigns, develop distribution channels and improve learner journeys to grow enrollment, participation and continued engagement. You’ll combine strong messaging and hands-on execution with experimentation and analysis to understand what drives results. You will work with Customer Education, Marketing, and account teams to grow participation and engagement in our education programs. In this role, you will: Set the quarterly education adoption and growth plan. Prioritize audiences, programs and channels using customer insight, field feedback and performance data. Lead campaigns that bring relevant audiences into our programs. Create campaign materials, test approaches and improve learner acquisition, working with Marketing and Marketing Operations on delivery. Build learner journeys with Lifecycle and program owners. Help employees get started, complete learning and take relevant next steps through timely, useful communications. Build distribution channels and resources that account teams and customers can use to promote learning across their organizations. Set and track team goals for enrollment, learner starts, completion and continued engagement. Use experiments to improve conversion and learner progression, partnering with CE Operations, Data Science and RevOps to assess how education contributes to product activation and sustained use. You might thrive in this role if you: Have owned education, activation, growth, lifecycle or content marketing programs for external enterprise customers, from audience strategy through launch and iteration, with measurable results in signups, activation and continued engagement. Have used audience segmentation, channel testing and lifecycle campaigns to grow participation and sustained engagement. Are a strong writer who creates clear, useful campaign content for different audiences. Have managed competing priorities and kept programs moving as customer needs and business priorities change. Use customer research, performance data and experiments to improve results. Use AI actively in your work and are curious about how it changes skills and learning. Nice to have Experience partnering with account teams to promote customer education or workforce learning programs. Experience working in a fast-paced technology company or similarly complex environment. About OpenAI OpenAI is an AI research and deployment company dedicated to ensuring that general-purpose artificial intelligence benefits all of humanity. We push the boundaries of the capabilities of AI systems and seek to safely deploy them to the world through our products. AI is an extremely powerful tool that must be created with safety and human needs at its core, and to achieve our mission, we must encompass and value the many different perspectives, voices, and experiences that form the full spectrum of humanity. We are an equal opportunity employer, and we do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability, genetic information, or other applicable legally protected characteristic. For additional information, please see OpenAI’s Affirmative Action and Equal Employment Opportunity Policy Statement . Background checks for applicants will be administered in accordance with applicable law, and qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records will be considered for employment consistent with those laws, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers, and the California Fair Chance Act, for US-based candidates. For unincorporated Los Angeles County workers: we reasonably believe that criminal history may have a direct, adverse and negative relationship with the following job duties, potentially resulting in the withdrawal of a conditional offer of employment: protect computer hardware entrusted to you from theft, loss or damage; return all computer hardware in your possession (including the data contained therein) upon termination of employment or end of assignment; and maintain the confidentiality of proprietary, confidential, and non-public information. In addition, job duties require access to secure and protected information technology systems and related data security obligations. To notify OpenAI that you believe this job posting is non-compliant, please submit a report through this form . No response will be provided to inquiries unrelated to job posting compliance. We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with disabilities, and requests can be made via this link . OpenAI Global Applicant Privacy Policy At OpenAI, we believe artificial intelligence has the potential to help people solve immense global challenges, and we want the upside of AI to be widely shared. Join us in shaping the future of technology.",
