    "summaryAr": "In 2026, we launched Computer, the defining product for the new era of agentic AI. Millions of people and teams adopt Perplexity and Computer on their own, and our marketing programs bring in thousands more leads. To turn that demand into pipeline, every lead has to be enriched, scored, and routed to the right next step within minutes. We're hiring a Growth GTM Engineer on the Revenue Operations team to own the lead-",
    "descriptionAr": "In 2026, we launched Computer, the defining product for the new era of agentic AI. Millions of people and teams adopt Perplexity and Computer on their own, and our marketing programs bring in thousands more leads. To turn that demand into pipeline, every lead has to be enriched, scored, and routed to the right next step within minutes. We're hiring a Growth GTM Engineer on the Revenue Operations team to own the lead-to-engagement engine: the enrichment platform that completes every marketing and product lead, the routing that sends each lead to nurture or to BDRs and Sales, and the syncs that move data from our warehouse into Salesforce and our GTM tools. You'll also put lead and account scores to work with Data Science, who own the scoring models, and help deliver our BDRs' prospecting tools. You'll report to the Head of Pipeline Operations, who sets the priorities for this work and owns our marketing automation platform, campaign operations and attribution. You'll build mostly with AI, so we care more about your instinct for go-to-market systems than your depth in any one programming language. You'll measure everything you build against meetings, pipeline and revenue. Tech stack: Salesforce | Clay | Reverse ETL (Hightouch or similar) | Routing and scheduling (Default, Chili Piper or similar) | Snowflake | SQL | Python | Computer | LLM APIs Why Perplexity is different Craftsmanship. We build high quality, tasteful products targeting both the AI native and AI curious. Ownership. You identify the problem, design the solution and ship it. Entrepreneurship. We think like founders, act with urgency, and hustle to deliver for each other and our users. Scholarship. Work among highly talented peers, pursuing knowledge and truth, upleveling ourselves, our teams, and our products. Partnership. We amplify each others' strengths, break down silos, and give selflessly to help our colleagues deliver excellence. What you'll do Own the enrichment platform. Design and run waterfall enrichment across third-party providers, AI research agents and first-party data for every marketing and product lead. Handle lead-to-account matching, deduplication, field governance, data freshness and provider cost. Publish enriched data to the warehouse for Data Science and other teams to use. Own lead routing. Design the decision logic that sends each lead, from marketing programs or product usage, to Marketing for nurture or to a BDR, AE or Account Manager for engagement, based on score, segment, territory, account ownership, capacity and existing opportunities. Co-define lifecycle stages, handoff SLAs, recycle rules and speed-to-lead triggers with the Head of Pipeline Operations, and enforce them in Salesforce and our routing tools, with MQLs and PQLs on the same lifecycle and SLAs. Deliver the enrichment, signals, routing and alerts behind our account-based plays. Own the syncs between our warehouse and our GTM tools. Build and maintain the reverse ETL syncs, APIs and webhooks that move data from Snowflake into Salesforce, marketing automation, routing and engagement tools. Build on the models the Data team publishes, and make sure every synced field has one owner and every sync is monitored. Support the rollout of our first marketing automation platform by building its Salesforce sync and warehouse feeds, along with the nurture enrollment rules and campaign tracking the Head of Pipeline Operations designs. Put lead and account scores to work. Data Science owns our scoring models, including product-qualified lead scoring. Partner with them on marketing-qualified lead scoring by bringing in enrichment data, marketing engagement and Sales feedback, and help set the thresholds that trigger action. Make sure scores and their reasons reach Salesforce on time and that Sales understands them. Close the feedback loop. Track the funnel from lead creation to closed-won. Find where leads stall, which sources and signals predict pipeline, and whether our qualification criteria still hold, then feed that back into routing, Marketing programs and Data Science's scoring work. Capture the campaign and touchpoint data behind attribution, which the Head of Pipeline Operations owns. Help deliver the BDR prospecting toolset. It combines vendor solutions and internal applications. The Head of Pipeline Operations owns these systems, and BDR leadership decides the sequences and plays that run on them. Implement the vendor tools and integrate them with Salesforce and our data. Build the workflows and agents around them, such as signal-triggered alerts, prioritized outreach queues and pre-call research briefs. Resolve the system and data issues that slow reps down. Supply our GTM Platform team, which builds our rep-facing applications, with the data, signals and requirements they need. Talk to users, track adoption and retire what doesn't get used. Partner across the business. Work with Marketing, Growth, BDR and Sales leadership, Data Science, Data Engineering, GTM Platform and Sales Systems to turn messy processes into durable systems, and use the scores and product usage signals Data Science and Growth publish to drive routing. What success looks like In your first 30 days: Audit enrichment coverage, routing rules, warehouse-to-Salesforce syncs and lead SLAs, and document the gaps that cost us pipeline. In your first 60 days: Ship an enrichment waterfall with measurable gains in fill rate and accuracy. Ship routing that sends every marketing and product lead to nurture or sales within an agreed SLA, with dashboards for speed to lead and conversion by route. Take ownership of the syncs that write scores and lead fields to Salesforce, with monitoring and one owner per field. Work with Data Science to bring enrichment and marketing engagement data into MQL scoring. In your first 90 days: Ship at least one prospecting workflow or agent with sustained weekly use by BDRs and AEs. Show a measurable lift in lead-to-meeting and meeting-to-opportuni",
